---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const sampleCreatives = [
  {
    num: 'FORMAT 01',
    title: 'The Notes App Screenshot',
    tag: 'Native / Organic Hook',
    image: '/vault-previews/thumb-notes-app.webp',
    whyItWorks:
      'Polished ads trigger instant scroll-past. A raw Notes app screenshot reads like leaked personal thoughts or a real workday realization. Viewers stop because it feels unfiltered, not like something a brand paid to show them.',
    productCategory: 'Gut Health Supplement',
    productExample:
      "Notes titled 'Things I cut in January' listing seed oils, gluten, and processed sugar. Final line: 'Bloating gone in 10 days. Skin cleared up. All I added was one capsule daily.'",
    serviceCategory: 'Freelance Tax Consultant',
    serviceExample:
      "Notes titled 'Write-offs my clients always miss' with bullet points: proportional home office rent, client gifts up to Rs 2,500, professional tool subscriptions, camera equipment. Final line: 'We recover an average of Rs 47,000 extra per client.'",
  },
  {
    num: 'FORMAT 02',
    title: 'The Google Search Bar',
    tag: 'Search Recognition',
    image: '/vault-previews/thumb-google-search.webp',
    whyItWorks:
      'When people hit a wall, their first move is typing it into Google. Putting that exact raw search phrase into your ad creates instant recognition in under a second. The viewer sees their own problem written out and immediately reads what comes next.',
    productCategory: 'Natural Deodorant Brand',
    productExample:
      "Search reads 'why does natural deodorant stop working after 2 weeks' and the solution below shows a pH-balanced formula that neutralizes odor bacteria rather than just masking smell.",
    serviceCategory: 'SaaS Onboarding Consultant',
    serviceExample:
      "Search reads 'why do users stop using the app after signup' and the solution shows a 3-point onboarding flow audit that lifts day-7 retention by identifying exact drop-off moments.",
  },
  {
    num: 'FORMAT 04',
    title: 'The Google Sheets Value Table',
    tag: 'Pricing & Value Contrast',
    image: '/vault-previews/thumb-sheets-table.webp',
    whyItWorks:
      'Spreadsheets feel objective and financial, not promotional. When a grid shows individual retail prices stacking up to a large total and then reveals your bundled price in a highlighted cell, the brain processes it as a pure mathematical bargain.',
    productCategory: 'Creator Preset Pack',
    productExample:
      'Spreadsheet shows Lightroom editing course at Rs 3,200, color theory workshop at Rs 1,800, 40 portrait presets at Rs 1,600, mobile preset pack at Rs 900. Total: Rs 7,500. Complete Creator Pack today: Rs 1,499.',
    serviceCategory: 'Brand Identity Studio',
    serviceExample:
      'Grid shows logo design at Rs 18,000, brand guidelines at Rs 12,000, social media templates at Rs 8,000, business card and letterhead at Rs 4,000. Total: Rs 42,000. Complete Brand Identity: Rs 24,000.',
  },
  {
    num: 'FORMAT 12',
    title: 'The Fake 1-Star Review',
    tag: 'Pattern Interrupt & Humour',
    image: '/vault-previews/thumb-fake-review.webp',
    whyItWorks:
      'Every human stops at a 1-star review because conflict and danger trigger attention. When they read it and discover the complaint is actually an ironic endorsement, the surprise creates a strong positive brand memory. The format uses negativity as the hook and delight as the payoff.',
    productCategory: 'Daily Productivity Planner',
    productExample:
      "One star. Headline: 'Do not buy this planner.' Review: 'I have been using it for 6 weeks and I have already finished 2 projects I had been putting off for 2 years. My procrastination no longer has anywhere to hide. I am now suspicious of how effective it actually is.'",
    serviceCategory: 'Ghostwriting & Content Agency',
    serviceExample:
      "One star. Headline: 'This writing team is genuinely a problem.' Review: 'My LinkedIn has gotten 14 inbound DMs from potential clients this month. I no longer have an excuse to avoid posting. My content manager has ruined my comfortable obscurity.'",
  },
];

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Why have you given ad teardowns instead of exact copy-paste templates? Wouldn’t templates be easier?',
    a: 'No, not really. If you copy someone’s ad word-for-word in an exact template, you rarely get a definitive result. Your product, customer avatar, and market context are completely different from what someone else is selling. Templatizing everything means everyone runs the exact same kind of ads, ad fatigue sets in fast, and performance collapses. What actually drives conversion is understanding the underlying psychological trigger, visual eye-path, and hook structure—and tailoring that concept to solve your specific customer’s acute pain points. The Vault gives you those proven mental models so you can create better, unique ads that convert consistently.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I get access to all future ad formats added to the Vault?',
    a: 'Yes, 100%. All the formats inside this vault are either used religiously by us in our agency client campaigns at Arqo Studio, or picked up from industry leaders and high-spending DTC brands who have tested them over millions in ad spend. We have tried and validated these concepts ourselves. As we uncover and test new winning concepts that fit this standard, you will get access to all of them directly in the Notion workspace and updated PDF at zero extra charge.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I mix and match ideas across different ads?',
    a: 'Yes, absolutely. Mixing and matching is the most important part because it unlocks your real creativity. You can take the layout of the Notes App or Google Search Bar, pair it with a Contrarian Hook from another format, and add a Review Breakdown. Giving your audience fresh combinations ensures they never get tired of seeing the same repetitive angle, letting you scale campaigns without creative fatigue.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Who is this actually built for (and who is it NOT for)?',
    a: 'This is built for anyone selling a problem-solving product or service. You could be selling physical DTC products (like skincare, wellness, ergonomic tools, apparel essentials), B2B SaaS, AI services, agencies, or high-ticket consulting. In all those scenarios, these ads perform exceptionally well. If you are selling purely novelty impulse items with zero utility, these frameworks can still give you visual inspiration, but their real superpower is communicating clear solutions to acute problems.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need complex design skills or expensive software?',
    a: 'No. While a few formats benefit from basic design polish, the majority of ads that win in modern Meta auctions can be made very simply using free tools like Canva or Figma in under 15 minutes. In fact, raw, authentic formats (like Notes App screenshots, spreadsheet tables, Reddit threads, and simple Ugly Ads) consistently outperform over-designed corporate graphics. These teardowns give you a proven starting point that instantly puts you ahead of 90% of advertisers pushing out random creatives.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I just use AI to make all of these creatives?',
    a: 'We strongly suggest NOT relying on AI 100% to generate these creatives. You can definitely use AI to assist with parts of the creative—like generating photorealistic lifestyle backdrops or brainstorming angle variations—but where AI struggles is nuanced marketing psychology, native typography, and subtle emotional nuance. 100% AI-generated creatives quickly look like recognizable "AI slop" that users scroll past instantly. Keep your creative native, clean, and authentic.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How does this compare to just browsing the Meta Ad Library for free?',
    a: 'The Meta Ad Library shows you what an advertiser launched, but tells you nothing about whether it actually turned a profit, why it stopped the scroll, or what psychological trigger drove the purchase. The Vault strips away the guesswork by breaking down the exact hook psychology, visual hierarchy, and real-world execution across both physical and service businesses so you don’t waste thousands of dollars on blind testing.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I access the Vault immediately after purchase?',
    a: 'Immediately upon checkout, you get instant access to the private Notion Workspace containing all 30+ detailed format cards and the rapid sprint checklist, plus a downloadable PDF edition you can keep offline. All future ad formats appear automatically inside your Notion dashboard.',
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Static Ad Vault | 30+ Proven Meta Ads & Breakdowns + Continuous Updates"
  description="Stop searching ad libraries from scratch. 30+ proven static ad formats and teardowns for problem-solving products and services. Plus new ads added regularly."
>
  <!-- TOP ANNOUNCEMENT -->
  <div class="border-b border-[#E24A1F]/20 bg-[#E24A1F]/[0.08] px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-[#E24A1F]">
    ⚡ Founding Offer: First 50 buyers get the Static Ad Vault (30+ Formats + All Future Adds) for ₹999.
  </div>

  <!-- HEADER: ONLY CENTERED LOGO FOR ALL BREAKPOINTS -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 w-full border-b border-[#E8E6E1] bg-[#FAF9F6]/90 backdrop-blur-md py-4 px-5">
    <div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center">
      <a href="/" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#141416]">Vatsal Jain<span class="text-[#E24A1F] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black leading-none ml-[0.5px]">.</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="flex-auto">

    <!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="border-b border-[#E8E6E1] bg-[#FAF9F6] py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E24A1F]/30 bg-[#E24A1F]/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#E24A1F] rounded-full">
            For Problem-Solving Products &amp; Services
          </div>

          <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141416] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl sm:leading-[1.15]">
            Get 30+ proven static ad formats you can steal, adapt, and launch this afternoon.
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
            30+ battle-tested static ad teardowns with the exact hook psychology, visual structure, and real-world examples for products and services. Pick a format, plug in your offer, and launch today.
          </p>

          <!-- HERO VIDEO WITH CORNER UNMUTE BUTTON -->
          <div class="mt-10 w-full max-w-3xl relative mx-auto rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-black shadow-lg overflow-hidden group">
            <video
              id="vault-hero-video"
              class="w-full h-auto aspect-video object-cover block cursor-pointer"
              autoplay
              muted
              loop
              playsinline
              preload="auto"
              poster="/vault-video-poster.jpg"
            >
              <source src="/vault-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
              <source src="/vault-video.webm" type="video/webm" />
              Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
            </video>

            <!-- Circular Unmute Button (Corner placement, never covers main video) -->
            <button
              id="vault-unmute-btn"
              type="button"
              class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6 flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 sm:h-14 sm:w-14 rounded-full bg-[#141416]/85 hover:bg-[#141416] text-white backdrop-blur-md border border-white/25 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer z-20 group"
              aria-label="Unmute video and play from start"
              title="Play with sound from start"
            >
              <!-- Pulsing indicator ring -->
              <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[#E24A1F]/30 animate-ping opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 pointer-events-none"></span>

              <!-- Muted icon -->
              <svg id="unmute-icon-muted" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="relative z-10 h-5 w-5 sm:h-6 sm:w-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M11 5L6 9H2v6h4l5 4V5z"/>
                <line x1="23" y1="9" x2="17" y2="15"/>
                <line x1="17" y1="9" x2="23" y2="15"/>
              </svg>

              <!-- Sound On icon -->
              <svg id="unmute-icon-sound" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="relative z-10 h-5 w-5 sm:h-6 sm:w-6 hidden transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"></polygon>
                <path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"></path>
                <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- PRIMARY HERO CTA -->
          <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center">
            <a
              href="https://pages.razorpay.com/static-ad-vault"
              class="vault-checkout-trigger inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#E24A1F] px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-[#C53B12] cursor-pointer"
            >
              Get The Vault for ₹999 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs text-[#5E5D64]">
            <span class="font-medium">✓ Instant digital access</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span class="font-medium">✓ Works for both products &amp; services</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span class="font-medium">✓ Access to all upcoming ad formats</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. THE PROBLEM -->
    <section id="problem" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E24A1F]">The Bottleneck</span>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141416] sm:text-4xl">
          Why Creative Testing Always Stalls
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[#5E5D64]">
          If your ad performance has flatlined, the problem is rarely your campaign budget setup. It is starting from zero every time you need new creative:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#E24A1F]">01. Starting From a Blank Canvas</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
            You spend hours scrolling the Meta Ad Library hoping for inspiration. Staring at an empty Canva or Figma artboard drains momentum before creation even begins.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#E24A1F]">02. Templates That Do Not Fit Your Solution</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
            Generic template packs and AI prompts look shiny in previews, but collapse when applied to real inventory, specific software dashboards, or unique services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#E24A1F]">03. Copying Graphics Without Understanding Why</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
            Copying competitor layouts without grasping the psychological trigger behind them wastes ad spend. When you understand the core mechanics, you can iterate with confidence.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#E24A1F]">04. Slow Production Kills Performance</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
            Waiting days for freelancers lets existing ads fatigue and customer acquisition costs rise. You need a fast, reliable starting point to produce new tests every week.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. THE SOLUTION (MEET THE STATIC AD VAULT - SIDE BY SIDE LAYOUT) -->
    <section class="border-y border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
          <!-- Left Column: Copy & CTA -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E24A1F]">The Solution</span>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141416] sm:text-4xl">
              Meet the Static Ad Vault
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
              The Static Ad Vault gives you <strong class="text-[#141416]">30+ battle-tested static ad formats</strong> paired with <strong class="text-[#141416]">tactical breakdowns</strong> of why they convert. It is built for any problem-solving business: from physical goods like skincare to software, AI services, and consulting.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">
              You get the hook structure, visual hierarchy, and buyer psychology. Mix and match these core principles to produce original, high-performing ads in an afternoon—with lifetime access to all future teardowns.
            </p>

            <!-- CTA -->
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
              <a
                href="https://pages.razorpay.com/static-ad-vault"
                class="vault-checkout-trigger inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#E24A1F] px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-[#C53B12] cursor-pointer"
              >
                Get The Vault for ₹999 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#8E8D94]">Instant digital access</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right Column: 3D Value Playbook Collage + 4 Points Below -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F3EF]/60 via-white to-[#F5F3EF]/40 p-3 sm:p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
              <!-- Subtle ambient glow -->
              <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3/4 h-3/4 rounded-full bg-[#E24A1F]/[0.04] blur-2xl"></div>

              <img
                src="/vault-previews/vault-mockup-collage.webp"
                alt="The Static Ad Vault - 30+ Proven Formats & Teardowns Playbook"
                class="relative z-10 w-full h-auto object-contain drop-shadow-md transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.01]"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>

            <!-- 4 Value Points Shifted Below Image -->
            <div class="mt-5 w-full grid grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 pt-4 border-t border-[#E8E6E1]">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#E24A1F] font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#141416]">30+ Formats</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-[#5E5D64]">Products &amp; Services</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#E24A1F] font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#141416]">Full Teardowns</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-[#5E5D64]">Psychology &amp; Hooks</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#E24A1F] font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#141416]">Sprint Checklist</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-[#5E5D64]">Rapid Execution</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#E24A1F] font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#141416]">Lifetime Access</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-[#5E5D64]">All Future Additions</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. SAMPLE CREATIVES (4 REAL BREAKDOWNS DIRECT FROM THE PLAYBOOK) -->
    <section id="samples" class="border-t border-[#E8E6E1] bg-[#FAF9F6] py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E24A1F]">Inside the Vault</span>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141416] sm:text-4xl">
            Sample Teardowns &amp; Creative Formats
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5E5D64]">
            Here is an unfiltered preview of 4 formats taken directly from the 30+ format Vault playbook. Notice how the exact same underlying psychological trigger works across both physical products and professional services:
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 space-y-12">
          {sampleCreatives.map((sample) => (
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-[#FAF9F6] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E8E6E1] pb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-[#E24A1F] bg-[#E24A1F]/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">
                    {sample.num}
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#141416]">{sample.title}</h3>
                </div>
                <span class="border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5E5D64] rounded mt-2 sm:mt-0">
                  {sample.tag}
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 items-stretch">
                <!-- Visual Ad Preview (5 cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col">
                  <div class="relative w-full flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white p-3 sm:p-5 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center min-h-[320px] sm:min-h-[380px] overflow-hidden group">
                    <img
                      src={sample.image}
                      alt={sample.title}
                      class="max-h-[340px] sm:max-h-[380px] w-auto max-w-full rounded-xl object-contain drop-shadow-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
                      loading="lazy"
                    />
                    <div class="absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 rounded bg-[#141416]/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-xs">
                      Real Vault Teardown
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="mt-2 text-center text-[11px] text-[#8E8D94]">
                    Exact creative format from the master PDF playbook
                  </span>
                </div>

                <!-- Breakdown Details (7 cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-5">
                  <!-- Why It Works (The Psychology) -->
                  <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E8E6E1] bg-white p-5 shadow-2xs">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                      <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#E24A1F]"></span>
                      <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141416]">Why It Converts (The Psychology)</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#3E3D42] leading-relaxed font-normal">{sample.whyItWorks}</p>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Two Application Cases: Physical Product & Service / SaaS -->
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                    <!-- Product Example -->
                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/50 via-white to-white p-4 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
                      <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                          <span class="text-sm">📦</span>
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Physical Product</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-[12px] font-bold text-[#E24A1F] mb-1.5">{sample.productCategory}</div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">{sample.productExample}</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Service Example -->
                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50/70 via-white to-white p-4 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
                      <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                          <span class="text-sm">💼</span>
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider">Service / SaaS</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-[12px] font-bold text-[#141416] mb-1.5">{sample.serviceCategory}</div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-[#5E5D64] leading-relaxed">{sample.serviceExample}</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. HOW IT WORKS (3 SIMPLE STEPS) -->
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
